From c94229b8035ebe5d50f78075c991fc6ad775c41a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:26:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Settings the port fixes, Nickname first, and the BC7 texture
 cache

Edits that were only in the local PortableKit checkout and never in a patch, so CI builds lacked them: the Aspect ratio, Scaling filter
and Texture filter rows are hidden (their values are fixed), the Texture pack and Ad hoc play toggles are gone, the Pause during
multiplayer option is gone (the game is never paused in multiplayer), Nickname is the first row of Play together, and the BC7 texture
cache with the bc7enc16 encoder (off by default).
